{
  "about": "Camera rates and limits (issue #175), outdoors: a right drag turns a degree a pixel; Shift tilts half a degree a pixel within 50-65 (25-65 with Ctrl); Ctrl zooms half a unit a pixel within 230-400 world units; a wheel step is 24.3 units; a double right-click with Ctrl puts the distance back to 300, with Shift the tilt to 50, and without either the turn to 0.",
